        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Jazz Door Lever Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe contemporary design and soft lines of the Jazz Lever will add a modern touch to any home. Fits standard door cutouts. Adjustable backset. Available in Bright Brass, Antique Brass, Satin Chrome, and Satin Nickel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install Schlage lever, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage levers will never tarnish, discolor, or corrode.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Jazz Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One Piece Lever for Better Security and Appearance</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard Pre-drilled Doors</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast Zinc Tubular Lock Housing</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty on Residential Applications</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Lever and Trim Rose</li>\r\n<li>Available in 4 Finishes</li>\r\n<li>Sold as Complete Set</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Install</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</B> of the F-Series Jazz Schlage Door Lever:<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-9/32\"</li></ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy: </b>For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet): </b>For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): </b>For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the lever while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
